    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc2e676847c632846c4cd75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后记得的，是那燃烧着欢愉的红色双瞳。\n还有痛楚。仿佛灵魂都被收割一般……深深的痛楚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2593ff84a45764d3912c24f0eaaa72cf313ce1955fb6b4b98b94a3029087ded2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
