    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:119664f36cc34672f91a5fad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒来时，倒在玄关。全身被冷汗浸湿。\n……昨夜的一切，难道只是被酷热折磨出的噩梦吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef91f7c757f740b42622bb88fd93693f7d7844ee565bdba27868840ddedac5dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
