      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下意识地捂住脖子。照镜子一看，脖子上竟然有一道陌生的\n红色痕迹。那痕迹仿佛是被什么咬过――",
      "source_fingerprint": "00338e688be121b177c6a5fedfa4fd5da5c4c69631ab8caf45898352c9492167",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
